data a_probe_whose_unit_never_ran_is_scored_as_the_forbidden_effect_refused: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "a_probe_whose_unit_never_ran_is_scored_as_the_forbidden_effect_refused" as NonEmptyStr,

  rung: RungUnread { cause: FoundAtAmbiguous },

  receipts: [
    "INVALID STATE: a negative probe (the forbidden write must be refused) reads any nonzero exit status as the refusal, so a unit that never executed the command counts as refused. HARM: the discriminating RED of gunbc.rung_drop.user_manager_worker_write_boundary_unenforced passed vacuously (silent wrongness, DESIGN section 5; rung inflation, section 4b). DISTINGUISHING FACTS: srv1 systemd 255 user manager exits 218 EXIT_CAPABILITIES in exec setup for the worker shape with EmptyCapabilityBoundingSet, about 20ms, before touch ran; only the positive control failed. Sibling instance in flight: the launcher cells scoring no drain answer as refused (PR 14619).",

    "RUNG NOW: mitigatable. The direct probes read never-ran, wrote, refused (touch's own status with the path absent) or inconclusive separately, and the refused claim requires a same-shape allowed touch to run. Executed evidence: test.claim.roadmap.sandbox_touch_reading_witness. CEILING: a probe's verdict cannot be structurally forced to carry the command's own status; a typed outcome per probe is the attainable form. NEXT TRIGGER: can climb after one grounding: a shared typed probe-outcome (ran / never-ran) in the claim surface so every negative probe must consume it; the census of other negative probes is not a prerequisite. The census prerequisite is retired by the 2026-10-30 process ruling (`gunbc.design_ruling bad_process_is_worse_than_no_process`); this does not establish corpus-wide coverage, and changes use scoped review and focused tests.",
  ],

  evidence: [
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "test.claim.roadmap.sandbox_touch_reading", decl_name: "sandbox_touch_reading_of", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "extdeps.systemd.service_exec", decl_name: "exec_setup_failure_of_status", field: WholeDeclaration },
